+stage timers -- it is charged to whichever call happens to sit around it -- so
+a presentation engine that reports SUBOPTIMAL forever reads as a mysteriously
+expensive backend, which is exactly how it presented on iOS: ~10 ms of a 16 ms
+frame with every measured stage summing to 3.
